                        <div class="conTxt"> 
      
     <P class=p style="TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0pt auto; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; LINE-HEIGHT: 19.15pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt" align=justify><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); LETTER-SPACING: 0.75pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>才经考场秋点兵，又历杏坛沐师风。</FONT>8月29日上午，我校五十周岁以下教师参加了绍兴市直学校教师基本功大比武。当天下午，为全面深入推进师德师风建设，进一步加强教师队伍的道德品质和教育素养，我校在图书馆报告厅二举行了师德师风培训。培训会由蒋明副校长主持。</SPAN></P>
<P class=p style="TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0pt auto; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; LINE-HEIGHT: 19.15pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt" align=justify><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); LETTER-SPACING: 0.75pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; LETTER-SPACING: 0.75pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-ascii-font-family: "&#13;&#10;mso-hansi-font-family:"color:rgb(245,211,70)"><?xml:namespace prefix = "o" ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p><A href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202009/2020090112205629.jpg" target=_blank><IMG onload=resizepic(this) onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202009/2020090112205629.jpg" width=6000 height=4000> </A></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=p style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0pt auto" align=center><SPAN><SPAN style="HEIGHT: 32px; WIDTH: 32px; POSITION: absolute; LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px auto auto 0px; Z-INDEX: 1"><IMG src="file:///d:/tmp/ksohtml20756/wps1.png" width=32 height=32></SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; LETTER-SPACING: 0.75pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-ascii-font-family: "&#13;&#10;mso-hansi-font-family:"color:rgb(245,211,70)"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=p style="TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0pt auto; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; LINE-HEIGHT: 19.15pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt" align=justify><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); LETTER-SPACING: 0.75pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>本次师德培训特邀浙江师范大学法政学院副教授刘映汐宣讲。刘教授指出，师德不仅指身为教师所应具备的职业道德，还有另一层含义，即教师所应具备的德性，如宽容、慈爱、包容等。师德师风的建设和培育要求教师注重培养优良的行为习惯，探索构建恰当的师生互动模式。教师需从一言一行开始，在师生互动中，不断地观察、总结、改进，在此过程中，理解学生，理解家长，并逐渐优化自己的言行。刘教授与全体教师分享了多个典型案例，并强调教师要明确站位立场，不搞标新立异，更不能哗众取宠。教师对待学生要常怀尊重，多鼓励支持，平等对待每一位学生。身为教师，需要学会说话的艺术，用宽容和慈爱对待每一个独一无二的学生。</FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=p style="TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0pt auto; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; LINE-HEIGHT: 19.15pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt" align=justify><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); LETTER-SPACING: 0.75pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; LETTER-SPACING: 0.75pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-ascii-font-family: "&#13;&#10;mso-hansi-font-family:"color:rgb(245,211,70)"><o:p><A href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202009/2020090112211785.jpg" target=_blank><IMG onload=resizepic(this) onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202009/2020090112211785.jpg" width=6000 height=4000> </A></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=p style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0pt auto" align=center><SPAN><SPAN style="HEIGHT: 32px; WIDTH: 32px; POSITION: absolute; LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px auto auto 0px; Z-INDEX: 1"><IMG src="file:///d:/tmp/ksohtml20756/wps3.png" width=32 height=32></SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; LETTER-SPACING: 0.75pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-ascii-font-family: "&#13;&#10;mso-hansi-font-family:"color:rgb(245,211,70)"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=p style="TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0pt auto; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; LINE-HEIGHT: 19.15pt; TEXT-INDENT: 27pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000" align=justify><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); LETTER-SPACING: 0.75pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>随后，蒋明副校长作总结发言。他指出，师德师风是教师的内在要求，每一位教师要认真学习教师职业道德规范，以强烈的使命感和责任感，树立良好的师德形象。同时，他还解读和宣讲了《浙江省教育厅关于做好普通高中新课程新教材实施工作的意见》，要求全体教师积极应对新课程改革，努力提升教学改革能力，为学校现代化建设做出积极的贡献。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); LETTER-SPACING: 0.75pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=p style="TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0pt auto; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; LINE-HEIGHT: 19.15pt; TEXT-INDENT: 26pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000" align=justify><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; LETTER-SPACING: 0.75pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-ascii-font-family: "&#13;&#10;mso-hansi-font-family:"color:rgb(245,211,70)"><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=p style="TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0pt auto; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; LINE-HEIGHT: 19.15pt; TEXT-INDENT: 27pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000" align=justify><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); LETTER-SPACING: 0.75pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>本次师德师风培训是我校本年度系列校本培训的一部分。早在</FONT>7月下旬，我校就举行了第一阶段的师德师风与教学能力提升培训，活动共持续了三天时间。</SPAN></P>
<P class=p style="TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0pt auto; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; LINE-HEIGHT: 19.15pt; TEXT-INDENT: 27pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000" align=justify><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); LETTER-SPACING: 0.75pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); LETTER-SPACING: 0.75pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><o:p><A href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202009/2020090112213942.jpg" target=_blank><IMG onload=resizepic(this) onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202009/2020090112213942.jpg" width=1440 height=1080> </A></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 等线; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><o:p><FONT face=宋体> </FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 等线; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><FONT face=宋体>7月27日，</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 新宋体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体"><FONT face=新宋体>浙江师范大学黄立新教授为全体老师带来了《活力媒体在智慧课堂中的创新与应用》的专题讲座，讲座生动活泼，老师们受益匪浅。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 新宋体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体"> </SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 新宋体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">   </SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 新宋体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体"></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 新宋体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体"><o:p><A href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202009/2020090112215744.jpg" target=_blank><IMG onload=resizepic(this) onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202009/2020090112215744.jpg" width=3648 height=2736> </A></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 新宋体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体"><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 等线; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><FONT face=宋体>7月28日上午，</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 新宋体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体"><FONT face=新宋体>浙江师范大学朱竞丰教授又为大家带来了题为《精准定位、精准教学、精准提升》的专题讲座，精彩的讲座让老师们对精准教学的理解又上了一个新台阶。</FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 新宋体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体"></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 新宋体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体"><o:p><A href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202009/2020090112221952.jpg" target=_blank><IMG onload=resizepic(this) onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202009/2020090112221952.jpg" width=3648 height=2736> </A></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 等线; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><o:p><FONT face=宋体> </FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 新宋体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">7月28日下午，还分学科组举行了师德师风与教学能力提升的大讨论。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 新宋体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 新宋体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体"><o:p> <A href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202009/2020090112223749.jpg" target=_blank><IMG onload=resizepic(this) onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202009/2020090112223749.jpg" width=2736 height=3648> </A></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); LETTER-SPACING: 0.75pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt">7月29日，中国健康管理协会首席讲师周紹瑾为大家带来了题为《疫情常态化下的师生健康管理》专题讲座。周老师用通俗易懂的语言给大家介绍了疫病发生的原因，并主要从中医的角度告知大家如何更好地预防疾病，最终拥有健康的身心并更好投入到工作和生活中。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); LETTER-SPACING: 0.75pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); LETTER-SPACING: 0.75pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></P>
